@host = http://localhost:5080
@pollSlug = esempio-domanda-abc123
@sessionKey = ABC123
@nickname = alice

### 1) Crea poll
POST {{host}}/api/polls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Qual è il tuo colore preferito?",
  "options": ["Rosso", "Blu", "Verde"]
}

### 2) Elenco poll
GET {{host}}/api/polls

### 3) Dettaglio poll
GET {{host}}/api/polls/{{pollSlug}}

### 4) Trova poll per sessionKey
GET {{host}}/api/polls/by-key/{{sessionKey}}

### 5) Verifica nickname
GET {{host}}/api/polls/{{pollSlug}}/participants/{{nickname}}

### 6) Entra nel poll
POST {{host}}/api/polls/{{pollSlug}}/participants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "alice"
}

### 7) Vota (200: { "hasVoted": true })
POST {{host}}/api/polls/{{pollSlug}}/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "alice",
  "optionId": 1
}

### 8) Risultati partecipante (403 finché il poll è aperto; disponibili a poll chiuso)
GET {{host}}/api/polls/{{pollSlug}}/results?nickname={{nickname}}

### 9) Stato host
GET {{host}}/api/polls/{{pollSlug}}/status

### 10) Chiudi poll
POST {{host}}/api/polls/{{pollSlug}}/close

### 11) Elimina poll
DELETE {{host}}/api/polls/{{pollSlug}}
